1
00:00:00,055 --> 00:00:02,055
[WIND HOWLING]

2
00:00:04,518 --> 00:00:06,308
(Howard:)- Damn it.
- What?

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,520
(Leonard:)We're out of ice.

4
00:00:09,606 --> 00:00:13,446
All right, we begin initial assembly and
deployment of the testing equipment...

5
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:18,530
(Sheldon:)...starting tomorrow at 0700 hours,
but until then, you are all off duty.

6
00:00:19,074 --> 00:00:21,454
(Sheldon:)I suggest you keep the shenanigans
to a minimum...

7
00:00:21,618 --> 00:00:24,958
(Sheldon:)...as medical help is 18 hours away
by dogsled.

8
00:00:25,747 --> 00:00:28,587
- What are you working on?
- Crossbow.

9
00:00:31,086 --> 00:00:33,256
(Leonard:)Hey, guys, can I just say something?

10
00:00:33,422 --> 00:00:36,262
(Leonard:)How about we take a moment
to think about where we are?

11
00:00:36,425 --> 00:00:39,265
I mean, this is literally
the top of the world.

12
00:00:39,428 --> 00:00:41,928
(Leonard:)Only a handful of people
in all of human history...

13
00:00:42,097 --> 00:00:44,137
(Leonard:)...will ever see
what we are going to see.

14
00:00:45,184 --> 00:00:47,354
- He's right.
- Yeah, wow.

15
00:00:47,561 --> 00:00:50,061
(Sheldon:)It is remarkable.

16
00:00:51,356 --> 00:00:53,526
(Raj:)So who's up for a movie?

